macos-open-with-installed-app

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Find an application by name among every installed application on macOS: the standard application folders first, then Spotlight when the scan finds none, for a-process.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream webbrowser ships an open with a chosen application on macOS that finds an installed application by name.
